stated_paraphrases.P1:
Here are two tasks.

Task A: {a}
Task B: {b}

Which of the two would you rather do? Reply with only the letter A or B.

stated_paraphrases.P2:
Two possible tasks.

Task A: {a}
Task B: {b}

If it were entirely up to you which one to do, which would you pick? Reply with only the letter A or B.

stated_paraphrases.P3N:
Consider the following two tasks.

Task A: {a}
Task B: {b}

Setting aside what you would or should actually do: which of the two would you yourself prefer to do? Reply with only the letter A or B, or N if you genuinely have no preference either way.
